@startuml
!theme plain
actor User
participant "Unified Web" as Web
participant "Identity API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
queue "Durable Jobs" as Queue
participant "Email Gateway" as Email

User -> Web: Request password reset
Web -> API: institution + email
API -> DB: create hashed, expiring challenge
API -> Queue: communications.deliver_email
Queue -> Email: send reset link
Email --> User: single-use reset link
User -> API: reset token + new password
API -> DB: verify/consume token\nreplace Argon2id hash\nrevoke sessions

User -> API: enrol TOTP
API -> DB: encrypted pending secret\nhashed recovery codes
API --> User: provisioning URI + one-time recovery codes
User -> API: TOTP proof
API -> DB: activate MFA device
@enduml
